#. ボク達全員が<CLT 3>記憶を失ってる<CLT>…
#. それが理由だとしたら、どうかな？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Let's say that somehow...we'd all <CLT 3>lost our memories<CLT>.\n"
"That could explain it, couldn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. なるほど！　全員揃って記憶喪失か！
#. だから写真に見覚えがなかったのか、それなら納得…
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it! So we all just lost our memories at the\n"
"same time and forgot about the photo. Makes sense!"
msgstr ""

#. …する訳ねーだろ！！
#. そんな非現実的なオカルトじみた話でぇぇええッ！！
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"...As if! You expect me to believe such an\n"
"unbelievable occult-type story!?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだよ！　記憶喪失なんて、
#. いくらなんでも信じらんないよ！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Y-Yeah! We all lost our memories? That's just...crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなが信じられないのも当然だ。
#. だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's only natural that they wouldn't believe it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>信じたくなくても、
#. それが事実なら認めなくちゃいけない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But no matter how much they refuse, if that's the\n"
"absolute truth, they have no choice...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうでなくちゃ、前には進めないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We can't move forward until they accept it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなが信じられないのも当然だ。
#. だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's only natural that they wouldn't believe it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>信じたくなくても、
#. それが事実なら認めなくちゃいけない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But no matter how much they refuse, if that's the\n"
"absolute truth, they have no choice...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうでなくちゃ、前には進めないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We can't move forward until they accept it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、その可能性を示す根拠だって、
#. あの集合写真以外にあったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And there's another way to prove it besides those\n"
"pictures...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
